=00_Af_gz9gp_UYML8ltViAT7YW4cfXwbrmnIY1MbhrgnRQZBA&oe=6A3FDBC2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B_lo6d4VgpcQ7kNvwEhTmTU&_nc_oc=AdoevKBfWV6wJX_LLC3PRRsO88pDl2ZBokXD74a5hmb6FcdDpKoD7OuQKaY2FTLEMog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-sC3wUuiYiOTxpny6CnQMtPaVvC9n23flezu6MaOFstQ&oe=6A3FD13F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AyMk3jmEs4UQ7kNvwEFQT0g&_nc_oc=AdoP1pNgTSpGxYVfwJ0pyqa6op70obXXJunB2cuwbFBkESTUO6U1k3cJfnYer2hlld0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af99YB9i3MzsRUgsbt4u0JV-NlsO6SAv9k5GsV3r_f0Fxg&oe=6A3FE030"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quick reflexes to survive.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Afterlife: Dead Zone delivers an immersive experience where you can only move physically within your designated play area, plunging you into a dark, destructive, and oppressive world.", "short_descr